    },
    {
      "name": "Cheddar cheese (optional)",
      "amount": "",
      "notes": "shredded"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat a copper pot over medium-high heat, and add the melted butter.",
    "Add the sliced potatoes to the pot, and cook for 5 minutes, or until golden brown and crispy.",
    "Add the minced garlic, chopped thyme, salt, and pepper to the pot, and stir to combine.",
    "Fold the ssam wraps in half, and place a scoop of the potato mixture onto one half of each wrap.",
    "Sprinkle shredded cheddar cheese on top of the potato mixture (if using).",
    "Fold the wraps in half, and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and the wraps are crispy.",
    "Serve immediately, and enjoy!"
